  "name": "Pork Fried Rice",
  "subtitle": "Savory rice with pork and crisp vegetables",
  "description": "Cooked rice, pork, mushrooms, and diced vegetables are stir-fried with garlic, ginger, and soy sauce for a complete skillet meal.",
